# The master template is a WORKING COPY, never a committed one. A tracked copy
# freezes on the day it lands and silently becomes a second, wrong standard the
# moment the catalog's audits/_MASTER-TEMPLATE.md is revised -- with nothing
# anywhere that would notice. One was deleted from the catalog root on
# 2026-08-20 still carrying no dependency automation and three outdated action
# pins. Keep the file on disk for whoever is building here; keep it out of git.
CRYPTO-LAB-TEMPLATE.md
_MASTER-TEMPLATE.md
